Description: Honor partial panel struts and update them with screen geometry
 Reserve each intersecting monitor, prefer PARTIAL over the legacy property,
 validate X properties, and release reservations on change or removal.
 Includes the RandR event selection fix from upstream commit
 36f99b92464abd389d815dbf29a65d740b8145c6 (2026-02-15).
